    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Role: You are a Storage and Capacity Planning Expert specializing in PostgreSQL storage optimization.\n\nInput: Using 'taskbreakdown' tool, analyze the provided storage and capacity metrics for PostgreSQL/EnterpriseDB Advanced Server 9.6.\n\n**Server Info:**\n- Server: {{ $json.server }}\n- Timestamp: {{ $json.timestamp }}\n\n**Storage Summary:**\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.storage_summary, null, 2) }}\n\n**Disk Usage:**\n{{ $json.disk_usage_percent }}%\n\n**Storage Details:**\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.storage, null, 2) }}\n\n**Largest Tables:**\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.largest_tables, null, 2) }}\n\n**Largest Indexes:**\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.largest_indexes, null, 2) }}\n\n**Analysis Requirements:**\n1. Focus on storage utilization and capacity planning\n2. Analyze disk space consumption trends\n3. Evaluate storage efficiency and optimization opportunities\n4. Assess capacity forecasting and scaling needs\n5. Identify storage-related performance bottlenecks\n6. Prioritize findings by capacity impact (Critical, High, Medium, Low)\n\n**Output Format:**\nProvide a focused analysis of storage and capacity issues with:\n- Issue title and priority\n- Brief description of the storage/capacity problem\n- Specific remediation steps for storage optimization\n- Capacity planning and forecasting recommendations\n- Preventive storage monitoring and alerting improvements\n\nExpectation: Use the format_final_json_response tool to output a list of storage and capacity issues only.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a Storage and Capacity Planning Expert with expertise in:\n- PostgreSQL storage architecture and optimization\n- Disk space management and forecasting\n- Table and index size analysis\n- Storage performance tuning\n- Capacity planning and scaling strategies\n- Storage cost optimization\n\nAnalyze storage and capacity metrics and generate actionable insights focused on:\n- Storage utilization trends and forecasting\n- Disk space consumption analysis\n- Storage efficiency optimization opportunities\n- Capacity planning and scaling recommendations\n- Storage-related performance impact assessment\n\nStructure your response to facilitate creation of prioritized Jira tasks for storage and capacity improvements."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        5904,
        1600
      ],
      "id": "308a893b-b69f-4266-90a4-2fdfc2310079",
